sequenceDiagram
    actor Learner
    participant UI as Together notebook
    participant API as Checked RPCs
    participant DB as learning_private
    actor Staff as Teaching staff
    actor Visitor
    Learner->>UI: Write outline
    UI->>API: save(id, fields, expected_updated_at)
    API->>DB: Authenticate owner; serialize cap; lock/version check
    DB-->>UI: Private draft + new version
    Learner->>UI: Consent and submit saved outline
    UI->>API: submit(id, expected version)
    API->>DB: Verify owner, completeness, current version
    DB-->>UI: submitted
    Staff->>API: List submitted work (optional learner filter)
    API-->>Staff: Staff-only author context and review content
    Staff->>API: Publish reviewed version or request changes
    API->>DB: Check staff, lock row, compare version
    Visitor->>API: List published discoveries
    API-->>Visitor: Explicit identity-free public fields
    Learner->>API: Submit supportive comment (stable UUID)
    API->>DB: Lock published parent; enforce caps; pending comment
    Staff->>API: Approve current comment version
    Visitor->>API: Read approved comments and encouragement count
    Learner->>API: Withdraw own project
    API->>DB: Make private; remove encouragement; requeue approved comments
    Note over API,DB: Atomic transactions and expected versions prevent stale approval and lost edits.
    Note over Learner,Visitor: Private reading reflections are never part of this publication flow.
